.PP
 \fR \fP 

.PP

.PP
\fR \fP 

.PP
SWC (stands for \fRSpeedy Web Compiler\fP) is a super-fast TypeScript / JavaScript compiler written in Rust\&. It's a library for Rust and JavaScript at the same time\&. If you are using SWC from Rust, see \fRrustdoc\fP and for most users, your entry point for using the library will be \fRparser\fP\&.

.PP
Also, SWC tries to ensure that

.PP
.RS 4
If you select the latest version of each crates, it will work 
.RE
.PP

.PP
for rust users\&.

.PP
MSRV of crates is currently \fR1\&.73\fP\&.

.PP
To update all SWC crates you use, you can run \fRcurl https://raw.githubusercontent.com/swc-project/swc/main/scripts/update-all-swc-crates.sh | bash -s\fP\&. This script will update all dependencies to the latest version and run \fRcargo build\fP to ensure that everything works\&. Note that you need

.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRjq\fP
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRcargo upgrade\fP
.PP

.PP
command to run the script\&.

.PP
Supported Node Versions:

.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
Node v10+ for usage
.IP "\(bu" 2
Node v20+ for development
.PP

.PP
.PP

.PP
If you are using SWC from JavaScript, please refer to \fRdocs on the website\fP\&.
